    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d114-a1">

                <pb facs="0700" n="673" sameAs="frus:frus1989-92v31/pg673"/>


                <head>Paper Prepared in the Delegation to the Nuclear and Space Talks in
                        Geneva<anchor n="2" xml:id="d114-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian">undated</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">32 ISSUES</p>
                <p rendition="#center">As Agreed by The Secretary and The Soviet Foreign Minister at
                    the April Ministerial in Washington</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Definition of new types of strategic offensive arms</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Warhead attribution for future types of ballistic missiles</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Basing terminology</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Sublimits on mobile ICBM launchers and on warheads on mobile ICBMs</item>
                    <pb facs="0701" n="674" xml:id="pg674"/>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Launchers on newly constructed submarines which have not yet begun sea
                        trials</item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Phasing of reductions of strategic offensive arms</item>
                    <label>7.</label>
                    <item>Provisions regarding initial accountability under the treaty</item>
                    <label>8.</label>
                    <item>Prohibition on rapid reload</item>
                    <label>9.</label>
                    <item>Cooperative measures to assist National Technical Means</item>
                    <label>10.</label>
                    <item>Restrictions on test and training launchers</item>
                    <label>11.</label>
                    <item>Telemetry issues: data exchange, exemptions from the encapsulation ban,
                        signal strength</item>
                    <label>12.</label>
                    <item>Strategic R&amp;D boosters</item>
                    <label>13.</label>
                    <item>Questions related to mobile ICBMs, including basing areas, categories of
                        movements and verification</item>
                    <label>14.</label>
                    <item>Launchers on submarines undergoing overhaul and conversion</item>
                    <label>15.</label>
                    <item>ICBM and SLBM warhead sublimits</item>
                    <label>16.</label>
                    <item>Perimeter/Portal Continuous Monitoring, including the establishment
                        thereof</item>
                    <label>17.</label>
                    <item>Suspect-site inspection</item>
                    <label>18.</label>
                    <item>New kinds: ASBMs, ICCMs</item>
                    <label>19.</label>
                    <item>Use of the terms “produce” and “develop”</item>
                    <label>20.</label>
                    <item>Non-deployment of strategic offensive arms beyond the national territory
                        and verification thereof</item>
                    <label>21.</label>
                    <item>Vehicles for launching objects into the upper atmosphere or space, and
                        limitations on the use of such vehicles</item>
                    <label>22.</label>
                    <item>Non-deployed missiles and the conversion or elimination of such
                        missiles</item>
                    <label>23.</label>
                    <item>Non-circumvention</item>
                    <label>24.</label>
                    <item>Duration</item>
                    <label>25.</label>
                    <item>Support equipment</item>
                    <label>26.</label>
                    <item>Throw-weight</item>
                    <label>27.</label>
                    <item>Unique identifiers</item>
                    <label>28.</label>
                    <item>Pre-inspection movement restrictions</item>
                    <label>29.</label>
                    <item>Definition of “inspection site”</item>
                    <label>30.</label>
                    <item>Precision of coordinates in the MOU</item>
                    <label>31.</label>
                    <item>Procedures for inspection before destruction of missiles in
                        canisters</item>
                    <label>32.</label>
                    <item>Restructuring of the Inspection Protocol</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
